      -- And since normal_round(r₂) is the floor, it's ≤ r₂
      -- But we need the reverse: that subnormal(r₁) ≤ normal_round(r₂)
      -- This follows from: subnormal(r₁) < firstNP and normal_round(r₂) ≥ firstNP

